<h2 id='why-this-comparison-matters' emoji='🏋️'>🏋️ Why This Comparison Matters for Gym Operators</h2>

<p>Email marketing remains one of the highest-ROI channels for fitness businesses. Whether you're running a boutique CrossFit box, a multi-location personal training studio, or a large commercial gym, your ability to automate member onboarding, win back lapsed members, and sell class packs through email directly affects monthly revenue.</p>

<p>We've helped operators managing thousands of member visits per month evaluate and implement email platforms, and the tool you choose matters more than most people admit. A clunky automation builder means sequences never get built. Poor segmentation means generic blasts that kill open rates. Bad deliverability means your win-back campaigns go to spam.</p>

<p>Moosend and AWeber both show up in fitness business searches regularly. We put both through their paces specifically for gym use cases — not generic ecommerce or SaaS workflows — and here's what we found.</p>

